00:16:33,342 --> 00:16:36,610
do that? I thought I understood.

235
00:16:45,970 --> 00:16:51,350
Mama Ann, you're awake already?

236
00:16:54,830 --> 00:16:57,440
You look upset, dear.
Did you get hurt? Huh?

237
00:16:57,770 --> 00:17:03,350
No, I just had a bad dream.
You died, mama. It was awful.

238
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:08,688
Silly girl.
Focus on finding your life's

239
00:17:08,772 --> 00:17:13,080
path and walk it
with confidence. Ah, mama.

240
00:17:13,650 --> 00:17:16,860
I know you can do it.
You're a good girl.

241
00:17:17,040 --> 00:17:21,280
Please don't cry, mom.
What's happening? You.

242
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:33,930
Huh? Was I?
Hey, what are you doing?

243
00:17:34,170 --> 00:17:37,628
I don't understand,
why would you. Huh?

244
00:17:37,742 --> 00:17:41,978
Your wing. Were you trying to
take it? I nearly had it, too.

245
00:17:42,092 --> 00:17:44,398
How could you? I told you. What

246
00:17:44,482 --> 00:17:48,170
about your friend?
And you're already betraying me.

247
00:17:50,630 --> 00:17:54,710
My friend. When you're
holding my life in your hands.

248
00:17:55,250 --> 00:17:58,388
You purchased me, remember?
You bet me to your

249
00:17:58,472 --> 00:18:04,760
will. We can never be friends.
I'm being a fool, aren't I?

250
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:09,830
You're right. That was naive.

251
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:12,428
Even though I purchased
you to serve me,

252
00:18:12,512 --> 00:18:15,440
I kept making selfish
requests to be your friend.

253
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:19,200
I won't let my guard down again.

254
00:18:22,970 --> 00:18:26,588
A caterpillar now stick
with scarecrow. And I want

255
00:18:26,672 --> 00:18:29,288
you to know that I'm going to
keep my promise no matter what.

256
00:18:29,372 --> 00:18:31,268
After we reach Lewiston,
I fully intend

257
00:18:31,352 --> 00:18:32,408
to give you your
ring back to you

258
00:18:32,492 --> 00:18:34,838
and then ask one more time
if you and I can be friends.

259
00:18:34,952 --> 00:18:37,340
Until then, I'm your master.
Understand?

260
00:18:39,710 --> 00:18:42,770
I bungled that,
but there's no need to rush.

261
00:18:42,980 --> 00:18:46,580
I've spent nearly 70 years
as a servant to humans.

262
00:18:46,790 --> 00:18:50,840
My freedom may have to wait,
but in three days.

263
00:18:52,750 --> 00:18:57,570
Again. Why does that scent
come from this girl?

264
00:18:58,990 --> 00:19:05,390
The sweet smell of silver sugar.
Liz.

265
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:10,908
We need to get
to the shelter within the day.

266
00:19:11,022 --> 00:19:13,200
We've traveled 200 Karen
on the highway.

267
00:19:13,350 --> 00:19:19,130
That's only a sixth
of the distance. To stop here.

268
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:24,450
Find that magic.

269
00:19:27,420 --> 00:19:28,770
Let's get them.

270
00:19:29,820 --> 00:19:33,168
They're coming this way.
Wait a second. You're a warrior.

271
00:19:33,252 --> 00:19:36,930
Fairy. You can get rid of them,
can't you? Too much work.

272
00:19:37,110 --> 00:19:41,220
Serious? I am your master.
If you don't, they'll kill us.

273
00:19:42,900 --> 00:19:45,618
What are you doing?
If you're my master,

274
00:19:45,702 --> 00:19:48,240
why are you asking?
Just order me.

275
00:19:49,110 --> 00:19:51,918
Come on now. Shouldn't you
go fight? You're blushing.

276
00:19:52,002 --> 00:19:53,940
I'm begging you
to stop those bandits.

277
00:19:54,870 --> 00:19:57,048
That didn't sound like an order.
If you

278
00:19:57,132 --> 00:19:58,758
don't stop playing games,
we'll die.

279
00:19:58,872 --> 00:20:01,158
Just say this.
Go slaughter those men

280
00:20:01,242 --> 00:20:04,690
or I'll tear up your wing. Do I.
Have to?

281
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:11,400
Order me to. I said go
or else I'll punch you.

282
00:20:12,930 --> 00:20:17,500
I suppose. That'll do.
As you wish, Lady Scarecrow.

283
00:20:22,747 --> 00:20:24,603
Careful.

284
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:41,050
The guy is a damn warrior fairy.
Turn back now.

